  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial release:\n- Standard error responses via RFC 7807 / 9457 ProblemDetails (AG1003)\n- Request correlation ID generation and propagation (AG1004)\n- Automated endpoint convention checks for routes and size policies (AG1001, AG1002, AG1005, AG1006)\n- Configurable modes: ReportOnly, Enforce, and Disabled\n- Diagnostic endpoint MapApiGuardrailsReport() and OpenTelemetry metrics",
